"""Build a numerical ImPi(Q,omega) table from the cube-based pipeline.

The primary saved object is the Enss-style full imaginary pair bubble,
`ImPi_full = ImPi_thermal`, plus the medium-only and no-thermal pieces
for diagnostics.
"""

